Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:01.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Same undhiyu:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.16,0:00:03.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,green in Surat, red in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.03,0:00:03.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kathiyawad!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:06.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,First, the name: it comes from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.13,0:00:07.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,'undhu', upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.31,0:00:08.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,The pot went into the ground
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.88,0:00:10.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,upside down, fire on top!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.77,0:00:12.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,Surti undhiyu means green
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.53,0:00:13.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,masala:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.03,0:00:14.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,coconut, coriander, green
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.79,0:00:16.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,garlic, green chilli.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.75,0:00:18.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,And brinjal, potato and raw
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.25,0:00:18.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,banana
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.59,0:00:20.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,get stuffed with that masala.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.68,0:00:22.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kathiyawadi undhiyu? Red chilli,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.82,0:00:23.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,more heat,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.49,0:00:25.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,and big pieces, nothing stuffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.11,0:00:27.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,So which team are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:28.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Green or red? Tell us in the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:29.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,comments!
